{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>8個層次!濃縮芫荽汁+本地皮蛋</p><p>觀塘小店推芫荽皮蛋盆栽蛋糕！</p><p>最近小編發現觀塘有間蛋糕網店推出好衝擊的芫荽皮蛋蛋糕，以法國朱古力製成盆栽造型，插滿新鮮芫荽，賣相已經好衝擊！盆栽內層以芫荽戚風蛋糕、芫荽慕絲、芫荽啫喱、皮蛋、法國朱古力腰果、Oreo碎碎等組合而成，另配上芫荽營養液(濃縮芫荽汁+海藻糖)，芫荽味超級澎湃，絕對是自己不食都要請朋友食！</p><p>食喵好Emeow 官方IG：@emeow_cakeshop</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179182082336769289_2620774876acd0417bac46.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179182082533910861_11770106196acd0419c4677.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179182082773339461_8859235606acd041bd6285.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179182082955117202_17179803756acd041dcea95.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T16:19:52.271392+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T16:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T19:42:12.384420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T16:17:54.156088+00:00","content_hash":"6484cd33d37d7520af12b80d06de93df1c80800c8d58a736af6d802c5249ffca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}